    <summary>Native Rust PC &amp; SSD storage cleaner for Windows 10 and 11 with a 7-day undo safety net.</summary>
    <description>SWEEPR Cleaner is a fast, lightweight native Rust PC cleaner and speed booster for Windows 10 and Windows 11. Features 60-second junk cleanup, complete app uninstaller, GPU shader &amp; game launcher cache cleaner, duplicate finder, and a 7-day undo safety net with zero background telemetry.</description>
